---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="404 - Page Not Found | ToolsRadar"
  description="The page or tool you are looking for does not exist or may have been relocated. Discover 900+ curated developer tools on ToolsRadar."
>
  <div class="not-found-container">
    <div class="not-found-content">
      <div class="not-found-badge">
        <span class="badge-dot"></span>
        <span>HTTP 404 • Resource Not Located</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="not-found-code">404</h1>
      <h2 class="not-found-title">Signal Lost in Deep Space</h2>
      
      <p class="not-found-desc">
        The tool dossier, comparison matrix, or guide you requested could not be found. It may have been renamed, merged, or relocated in our daily catalog index.
      </p>

      <div class="not-found-actions">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">
          <span>⚡ Browse All 920+ Tools</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/vs" class="btn btn-secondary">
          <span>🔄 Head-to-Head Comparisons</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="quick-links-card">
        <h3 class="quick-links-title">Popular Radar Destinations</h3>
        <div class="quick-links-grid">
          <a href="/category/ai-agents" class="quick-link-item">
            <span class="quick-icon">🤖</span>
            <div>
              <strong>AI Agents & Workflows</strong>
              <span>Autonomous coding & LLM orchestration</span>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a href="/category/developer-tools" class="quick-link-item">
            <span class="quick-icon">🛠️</span>
            <div>
              <strong>DevTools & CLI Utilities</strong>
              <span>Terminal speedups & dev ergonomics</span>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a href="/category/open-source" class="quick-link-item">
            <span class="quick-icon">🌐</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Open Source Alternatives</strong>
              <span>Self-hosted & license-free utilities</span>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a href="/guides" class="quick-link-item">
            <span class="quick-icon">📚</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Technical Guides Hub</strong>
              <span>Architecture breakdowns & best practices</span>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a href="/best" class="quick-link-item">
            <span class="quick-icon">🏆</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Best Software Rankings</strong>
              <span>Curated editorial top-tier benchmarks</span>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a href="/contact" class="quick-link-item">
            <span class="quick-icon">✉️</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Report a Missing Tool</strong>
              <span>Reach out to the ToolsRadar editorial team</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .not-found-container {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 3rem auto 5rem;
    padding: 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .not-found-content {
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .not-found-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f87171;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .badge-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #ef4444;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ef4444;
  }

  .not-found-code {
    font-size: 6.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #38bdf8 0%, #818cf8 50%, #c084fc 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .not-found-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .not-found-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 580px;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }

  .not-found-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .quick-links-card {
    width: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20, 22, 32, 0.7) 0%, rgba(14, 15, 22, 0.85) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .quick-links-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .quick-links-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .quick-links-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .quick-link-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .quick-link-item:hover {
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08);
    border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .quick-icon {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .quick-link-item strong {
    display: block;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .quick-link-item span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
</style>
